{"title":"Tome Toolsmithing Silver","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Hill Giant Adolescent, Orc Shieldwall</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"orc-shieldwall\" title=\"Orc Shieldwall - dropped it in 1 of 27 looted corpses (1/27)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/4e139db242c706733de0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc Shieldwall</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/27<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-adolescent\" title=\"Hill Giant Adolescent - dropped it in 1 of 30 looted corpses (1/30)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9beef5a6d257406a5827.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Adolescent</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/30<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"tome-toolsmithing-silver\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/7fa528915b83e935fc89.svg\" alt=\"Tome Toolsmithing Silver\"></div><h3>Tome Toolsmithing Silver</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/13/2026, 1:19:36 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}